-0"><div class="m_4ba554d4 mantine-Accordion-content" style="padding:0 var(--mantine-spacing-s400) var(--mantine-spacing-s400) var(--mantine-spacing-s400)"><div><div class="payload-richtext"><p>No. Todos los autobuses ADO que se venden en este sitio usan Valladolid C.46, en la Calle 46 del centro.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div style="border:1px solid var(--mantine-color-gray-2);overflow:hidden" class="m_9f59b069 m_9bd7b098 mantine-Accordion-item"><button style="padding:var(--mantine-spacing-s400);gap:var(--mantine-spacing-s300)" class="mantine-focus-auto m_4ba585b8 mantine-Accordion-control m_87cf2631 mantine-UnstyledButton-root" data-accordion-control="true" data-chevron-position="right" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mantine-_R_5cr5lalfiusqabsnpfivb_-panel-item-1" id="mantine-_R_5cr5lalfiusqabsnpfivb_-control-item-1"><span style="width:24px;height:24px;color:var(--mantine-color-gray-6);justify-content:center" class="m_3f35ae96 mantine-Accordion-chevron" data-position="right"><svg viewBox="0 0 15 15" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="width:calc(1rem * var(--mantine-scale));height:calc(1rem * var(--mantine-scale));display:block"><path d="M3.13523 6.15803C3.3241 5.95657 3.64052 5.94637 3.84197 6.13523L7.5 9.56464L11.158 6.13523C11.3595 5.94637 11.6759 5.95657 11.8648 6.15803C12.0536 6.35949 12.0434 6.67591 11.842 6.86477L7.84197 10.6148C7.64964 10.7951 7.35036 10.7951 7.15803 10.6148L3.15803 6.86477C2.95657 6.67591 2.94637 6.35949 3.13523 6.15803Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span><span class="m_df3ffa0f mantine-Accordion-label" style="font-family:var(--mantine-font-family-headings);font-size:var(--mantine-font-size-lg);font-weight:600;line-height:24px;color:var(--mantine-color-gray-9);padding:0"><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:var(--mantine-spacing-s300)"><h3 class="puck-accordion__title">¿Dónde está la terminal de autobuses de Valladolid?</h3></div></span></button><div style="box-sizing:border-box;opacity:0;transition:opacity 200ms ease;font-size:var(--mantine-font-size-md);line-height:24px;color:var(--mantine-color-gray-9);height:0;overflow:hidden;display:none" class="m_df78851f mantine-Accordion-panel" aria-hidden="true" role="region" id="mantine-_R_5cr5lalfiusqabsnpfivb_-panel-item-1" aria-labelledby="mantine-_R_5cr5lalfiusqabsnpfivb_-control-item-1" inert=""><div class="m_4ba554d4 mantine-Accordion-content" style="padding:0 var(--mantine-spacing-s400) var(--mantine-spacing-s400) var(--mantine-spacing-s400)"><div><div class="payload-richtext"><p>En la Calle 46 #197, a unos 400 m del parque principal, a 5 minutos a pie.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div style="border:1px solid var(--mantine-color-gray-2);overflow:hidden" class="m_9f59b069 m_9bd7b098 mantine-Accordion-item"><button style="padding:var(--mantine-spacing-s400);gap:var(--mantine-spacing-s300)" class="mantine-focus-auto m_4ba585b8 mantine-Accordion-control m_87cf2631 mantine-UnstyledButton-root" data-accordion-control="true" data-chevron-position="right" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mantine-_R_5cr5lalfiusqabsnpfivb_-panel-item-2" id="mantine-_R_5cr5lalfiusqabsnpfivb_-control-item-2"><span style="width:24px;height:24px;color:var(--mantine-color-gray-6);justify-content:center" class="m_3f35ae96 mantine-Accordion-chevron" data-position="right"><svg viewBox="0 0 15 15" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="width:calc(1rem * var(--mantine-scale));height:calc(1rem * var(--mantine-scale));display:block"><path d="M3.13523 6.15803C3.3241 5.95657 3.64052 5.94637 3.84197 6.13523L7.5 9.56464L11.158 6.13523C11.3595 5.94637 11.6759 5.95657 11.8648 6.15803C12.0536 6.35949 12.0434 6.67591 11.842 6.86477L7.84197 10.6148C7.64964 10.7951 7.35036 10.7951 7.15803 10.6148L3.15803 6.86477C2.95657 6.67591 2.94637 6.35949 3.13523 6.15803Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span><span class="m_df3ffa0f mantine-Accordion-label" style="font-family:var(--mantine-font-family-headings);font-size:var(--mantine-font-size-lg);font-weight:600;line-height:24px;color:var(--mantine-color-gray-9);padding:0"><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:var(--mantine-spacing-s300)"><h3 class="puck-accordion__title">¿Los autobuses ADO paran en la estación del Tren Maya de Valladolid?</h3></div></span></button><div style="box-sizing:border-box;opacity:0;transition:opacity 200ms ease;font-size:var(--mantine-font-size-md);line-height:24px;color:var(--mantine-color-gray-9);height:0;overflow:hidden;display:none" class="m_df78851f mantine-Accordion-panel" aria-hidden="true" role="region" id="mantine-_R_5cr5lalfiusqabsnpfivb_-panel-item-2" aria-labelledby="mantine-_R_5cr5lalfiusqabsnpfivb_-control-item-2" inert=""><div class="m_4ba554d4 mantine-Accordion-content" style="padding:0 var(--mantine-spacing-s400) var(--mantine-spacing-s400) var(--mantine-spacing-s400)"><div><div class="payload-richtext"><p>No. La estación del Tren Maya está a unos 6 km al norte del centro y es solo para el tren.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div style="border:1px solid var(--mantine-color-gray-2);overflow:hidden" class="m_9f59b069 m_9bd7b098 mantine-Accordion-item"><button style="padding:var(--mantine-spacing-s400);gap:var(--mantine-spacing-s300)" class="mantine-focus-auto m_4ba585b8 mantine-Accordion-control m_87cf2631 mantine-UnstyledButton-root" data-accordion-control="true" data-chevron-position="right" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mantine-_R_5cr5lalfiusqabsnpfivb_-panel-item-3" id="mantine-_R_5cr5lalfiusqabsnpfivb_-control-item-3"><span style="width:24px;height:24px;color:var(--mantine-color-gray-6);justify-content:center" class="m_3f35ae96 mantine-Accordion-chevron" data-position="right"><svg viewBox="0 0 15 15" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="width:calc(1rem * var(--mantine-scale));height:calc(1rem * var(--mantine-scale));display:block"><path d="M